Source: niaos-integration
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Maintainer: NiaOS Developers <developers@niaos.invalid>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: niaos-release
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, base-files (>= 13)
Description: NiaOS distribution identity
 Distribution identity maintained with a reversible dpkg diversion.
 The upstream Debian base-files package is retained unmodified.

Package: niaos-defaults
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, niaos-release, unattended-upgrades
Description: NiaOS defaults using supported configuration interfaces
 GRUB naming and Debian 13 security update policy in separate configuration
 snippets. Local administrator configuration remains under dpkg control.

Package: niaos-base
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, niaos-defaults, linux-image-amd64, systemd-sysv,
 network-manager, systemd-timesyncd, ca-certificates, sudo, apparmor,
 cryptsetup-initramfs, xfsprogs, e2fsprogs, locales, less, nano
Description: NiaOS base system metapackage
 Debian 13 base system, networking, encryption and filesystem utilities.

Package: niaos-desktop-kde
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, niaos-base, task-kde-desktop, fonts-noto-cjk,
 fcitx5-mozc, im-config
Description: NiaOS KDE Plasma desktop metapackage
 Standard Debian KDE desktop with Japanese fonts and input support.

Package: niaos-desktop-gnome
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, niaos-base, task-gnome-desktop, fonts-noto-cjk,
 ibus-mozc
Description: NiaOS GNOME desktop metapackage
 Standard Debian GNOME desktop with Japanese fonts and input support.
